WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.550 --> 00:00:02.600 line:-2
<v Scott Stewart>Stewart: Mr. Chief Justice, and may it please the Court:

2
00:00:03.300 --> 00:00:06.900 line:-2
<v Scott Stewart>Roe versus Wade and Planned Parenthood versus Casey haunt our country.

3
00:00:07.500 --> 00:00:09.100 line:-2
<v Scott Stewart>They have no basis in the Constitution.

4
00:00:09.400 --> 00:00:11.500 line:-2
<v Scott Stewart>They have no home in our history or traditions.

5
00:00:12.000 --> 00:00:13.600 line:-2
<v Scott Stewart>They’ve damaged the democratic process.

6
00:00:14.000 --> 00:00:16.600 line:-2
<v Scott Stewart>They’ve poisoned the law. They’ve choked off compromise.

7
00:00:17.400 --> 00:00:20.400 line:-2
<v Scott Stewart>For 50 years, they’ve kept this Court at the center of a political battle

8
00:00:20.400 --> 00:00:22.000 line:-2
<v Scott Stewart>that it can never resolve.

9
00:00:22.400 --> 00:00:27.100 line:-2
<v Justice Sonia Sotomayor>Sotomayor: Now the sponsors of this bill, the House bill, in Mississippi,

10
00:00:27.600 --> 00:00:30.900 line:-2
<v Justice Sonia Sotomayor>said we’re doing it because we have new justices.

11
00:00:31.200 --> 00:00:36.000 line:-2
<v Justice Sonia Sotomayor>Will this institution survive the stench

12
00:00:36.400 --> 00:00:41.000 line:-2
<v Justice Sonia Sotomayor>that this creates in the public perception

13
00:00:42.400 --> 00:00:49.800 line:-2
<v Justice Sonia Sotomayor>that the Constitution and its reading are just political acts?
